Compiler Pipeline:

    Source Code
        |
        v
      Lexer -----------+
        |              |
      Tokens           |
        |              |
        v              |
      Parser ----------+
        |              |
       AST             |
        |              |
        v              |
  Semantic Analysis ---+
        |              |
    Typed AST          |
        |              |
        v              |
     Codegen ----------+
        |
    Native Code
        |
        v
      Linker
        |
        v
    Executable


  Diagnostics:

    Lexer  --------\
    Parser ---------\
    Sema ------------> Diagnostics
    Codegen --------/

  Diagnostics reports:
    - Errors
    - Warnings
    - Source location
    - Line / column
    - Error messages
